#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:4
msgid "Anthropic API compatibility"
msgstr "Anthropic API 兼容"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:6
msgid ""
"Xinference exposes Anthropic-compatible Messages APIs for already launched "
"models. Use the model UID in requests. The available features depend on the "
"model and engine."
msgstr ""
"Xinference 为已启动的模型提供兼容 Anthropic 的 Messages API。请求中使用模型 UID。可用功能取决于模型和推理引擎。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:11
msgid "Endpoints and authentication"
msgstr "接口与认证"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:13
msgid ""
"Send message requests to ``/v1/messages`` and token-count requests to "
"``/v1/messages/count_tokens``. The standard routes require ``anthropic-"
"version: 2023-06-01``. The ``/anthropic/v1/messages`` and "
"``/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens`` aliases remain available."
msgstr ""
"消息请求发送到 ``/v1/messages``，token 计数请求发送到 "
"``/v1/messages/count_tokens``。标准接口要求提供 ``anthropic-version: "
"2023-06-01``。同时保留 ``/anthropic/v1/messages`` 和 "
"``/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens`` 别名接口。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:18
msgid ""
"Use your Xinference API key when authentication is enabled. An arbitrary "
"non-empty key is sufficient when authentication is disabled."
msgstr "启用认证时，使用你的 Xinference API key。未启用认证时，任意非空 key 即可。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:22
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:24
msgid ""
"Launch a model with chat and tool-calling support first (see :ref:`launch`),"
" then configure Claude Code to use the Xinference server and model UID:"
msgstr ""
"先启动支持聊天和工具调用的模型（参见 :ref:`launch`），然后配置 Claude Code 使用 Xinference 服务地址和模型 "
"UID："

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:38
msgid "Python SDK"
msgstr "Python SDK"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:57
msgid "Token counting"
msgstr "Token 计数"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:59
msgid ""
"The standard ``/v1/messages/count_tokens`` endpoint and its "
"``/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens`` alias use the loaded model's chat "
"template and tokenizer, including tool definitions and images where "
"supported. Both routes use the same model permissions and Xinference API key"
" as message generation."
msgstr ""
"标准计数端点 ``/v1/messages/count_tokens`` 及别名 "
"``/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens`` 使用已加载模型的聊天模板与 "
"tokenizer，并在支持时计入工具定义和图像。两个接口使用与消息生成相同的模型权限和 Xinference API key。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:74
msgid "Images and documents"
msgstr "图像与文档"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:76
msgid ""
"Messages support text, base64 or URL images, tool results containing images,"
" and tool references to tools declared in the request. Plain-text documents "
"are supported; PDF pages are rendered as images with ``pypdfium2`` (install "
"the ``image`` extra), require a vision model, and are limited to 20 pages "
"per request. File IDs and document citations are not supported."
msgstr ""
"消息支持文本、base64 或 URL 图像、包含图像的工具结果，以及对请求中已声明工具的引用。支持纯文本文档；PDF 通过 ``pypdfium2``"
" 渲染为图像（安装 ``image`` 扩展依赖），需要视觉模型，每个请求最多 20 页。不支持文件 ID 和文档引用标注。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:83
msgid ""
"Xinference's vLLM vision models default to two images per prompt. The limit "
"includes images in conversation history and tool results, so successive "
"single-image messages can also exceed it. Set ``limit_mm_per_prompt`` when "
"launching the model, for example ``{\"image\": 8, \"video\": 0}``, to allow "
"more images within the model's context length and available GPU memory."
msgstr ""
"Xinference 的 vLLM "
"视觉模型默认每个提示词最多接收两张图片。该上限包括对话历史和工具结果中的图片，因此连续发送单图消息也可能超限。启动模型时设置 "
"``limit_mm_per_prompt``，例如 ``{\"image\": 8, \"video\": 0}``，即可在模型上下文长度和可用 "
"GPU 显存范围内接收更多图片。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:89
msgid ""
"PDF limits apply to the entire request: at most 20 pages and 20 million "
"rendered pixels. Decoded PDF bytes and rendered PNG bytes each use "
"``XINFERENCE_MEDIA_MAX_BYTES`` (64 MiB by default). Each PDF block is "
"rendered once per request, and model access is checked before fetching or "
"rendering content."
msgstr ""
"PDF 限制针对整个请求：最多 20 页、2000 万个渲染像素。解码后的 PDF 字节和渲染后的 PNG 字节各自受 "
"``XINFERENCE_MEDIA_MAX_BYTES`` 限制（默认为 64 MiB）。每个 PDF "
"内容块在一次请求中仅渲染一次，获取或渲染内容前会检查模型访问权限。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:83
msgid "Thinking"
msgstr "思考模式"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:102
msgid ""
"Adaptive thinking enables the model's reasoning mode. The ``effort`` option "
"maps to prompt guidance, with ``medium`` preserving the default prompt. "
"Explicit thinking responses carry Xinference signatures, which can be "
"replayed with the same model UID and signing key; configure "
"``XINFERENCE_ANTHROPIC_THINKING_SECRET`` consistently across API servers. "
"SGLang enforces manual ``budget_tokens`` with its request-level "
"``max_thinking_tokens`` control when strict thinking is enabled. Unsupported"
" versions or disabled strict thinking return HTTP 501 for a manual budget. "
"MLX and vLLM do not currently enforce a separate reasoning-token limit."
msgstr ""
"Adaptive thinking 启用模型的推理模式。``effort`` 映射为提示词指导，``medium`` "
"保持默认提示词。显式请求的思考响应带有 Xinference 签名，可以使用相同的模型 UID 和签名密钥回传；多个 API 服务器应配置相同的 "
"``XINFERENCE_ANTHROPIC_THINKING_SECRET``。 SGLang 在启用严格思考时，通过请求级 "
"``max_thinking_tokens`` 执行手动 ``budget_tokens`` 限制。版本不支持或严格思考未启用时，手动预算请求返回 "
"HTTP 501。MLX 和 vLLM 目前不执行独立的推理 token 上限。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:105
msgid ""
"Stale, unsigned or foreign thinking blocks are ignored during replay; "
"accompanying answers and tool calls are preserved."
msgstr "回放历史时会忽略失效、未签名或外来的 thinking 块，同时保留其附带的回答和工具调用。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:92
msgid "Tool choice and structured output"
msgstr "工具选择与结构化输出"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:152
msgid ""
"The vLLM, SGLang and MLX engines support structured JSON, named and required"
" tool choice through constrained JSON decoding. Disabled parallel tool use "
"returns at most one tool per response. Forced tool arguments are buffered "
"until complete."
msgstr ""
"vLLM、SGLang 和 MLX 引擎通过约束 JSON 解码支持结构化 "
"JSON、指定工具和必选工具。禁用并行工具后，每个响应最多返回一个工具调用。强制工具参数会缓冲至完整后再输出。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:157
msgid ""
"Xinference automatically connects its existing reasoning parser to vLLM and "
"SGLang structured decoding for supported reasoning markers and engines with "
"parser plugin support. Qwen3.5 needs no extra parser configuration. Explicit"
" engine parser settings are preserved. Manual thinking cannot be combined "
"with forced tool choice. P/D models return 501 for forced tool choice. Other"
" engines return 501 for unsupported controls. MLX uses ``llguidance`` "
"(included in the ``mlx`` extra) with a fast tokenizer. Requests with "
"constrained output or explicit cache checkpoints use request-local decoding;"
" other text requests retain continuous batching."
msgstr ""
"对于支持的思考标记和具备 parser 插件能力的引擎，Xinference 会自动将已有的 reasoning parser 接入 vLLM 和 "
"SGLang 的结构化解码。Qwen3.5 无需额外配置 parser。用户显式指定的引擎 parser "
"设置会保留。手动思考模式不能与强制工具选择组合。其他引擎对不支持的控制项返回 501。 P/D 模型对强制工具选择返回 501。 MLX 使用 "
"``llguidance``（包含在 ``mlx`` 额外依赖中）和快速 "
"tokenizer。约束请求和带显式缓存检查点的请求使用独立解码器；其他文本请求保留连续批处理。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:103
msgid "Prompt caching"
msgstr "提示词缓存"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:221
msgid ""
"For text requests, both MLX text and vision models support up to four "
"explicit ``cache_control`` breakpoints. Each checkpoint has its own ``5m`` "
"or ``1h`` lifetime, refreshed on a cache hit. Put longer lifetimes before "
"shorter ones. Expired checkpoints are removed independently; a live earlier "
"checkpoint can still be reused after a later one expires. Cache storage "
"obeys the configured ``prompt_cache_size`` and ``prompt_cache_bytes`` "
"capacity limits, so memory pressure can evict checkpoints before their "
"lifetime ends. Usage reports actual cache writes and reads."
msgstr ""
"对于文本请求，MLX 文本和视觉模型均支持最多四个显式 ``cache_control`` 断点。每个检查点独立采用 ``5m`` 或 ``1h`` "
"有效期，缓存命中时续期。较长有效期必须在较短有效期之前。过期检查点分别移除；后续检查点过期后，仍可复用前面有效的检查点。缓存遵守 "
"``prompt_cache_size`` 和 ``prompt_cache_bytes`` "
"容量限制，内存压力可能使检查点提前被淘汰。用量报告实际缓存写入和读取。"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:83
msgid ""
"The request-wide safety limit is 64 rendered images, counting direct images,"
" tool-result images and PDF pages together. A lower deployment limit still "
"applies. Exceeding either limit returns HTTP 400 before generation, "
"including for streaming requests."
msgstr ""
"整个请求的安全上限为 64 张渲染后的图像，直接输入的图像、工具结果中的图像和 PDF "
"页面合并计数。如果部署上限更低，该上限仍然生效。超过任一上限都会在生成前返回 HTTP 400，流式请求也不例外。"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:113
msgid ""
"On physical vLLM models, ``stop_sequences`` applies to streaming and non-"
"streaming requests, including when thinking is disabled. A stop match during"
" thinking can end the response before a final answer is produced. A matching"
" caller-provided string returns ``stop_reason: \"stop_sequence\"`` and the "
"exact ``stop_sequence``. EOS and token-ID stops return ``end_turn`` with a "
"null ``stop_sequence``."
msgstr ""
"在 vLLM 物理模型上，``stop_sequences`` "
"对流式和非流式请求均生效，包括禁用思考的情况。思考期间命中停止序列可能使响应在生成最终答案前结束。命中调用方指定的字符串时，返回 "
"``stop_reason: \"stop_sequence\"`` 和实际匹配的 ``stop_sequence``。由 EOS 或令牌 ID "
"触发的停止返回 ``end_turn``，且 ``stop_sequence`` 为 null。"

#: user_guide/anthropic.rst:120
msgid ""
"For physical vLLM models, disconnecting from a streaming or non-streaming "
"Messages request aborts generation and releases request capacity."
msgstr "对于 vLLM 物理模型，流式或非流式 Messages 请求断开连接后，会中止生成并释放请求处理容量。"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:118
msgid "Context management"
msgstr "上下文管理"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:120
msgid ""
"``context_management`` supports ``clear_thinking_20251015``. Set ``keep`` to"
" ``\"all\"`` or ``{\"type\": \"all\"}`` to retain all thinking (the "
"default), or use a positive ``thinking_turns`` value to retain recent "
"thinking turns:"
msgstr ""
"``context_management`` 支持 ``clear_thinking_20251015``。将 ``keep`` 设为 "
"``\"all\"`` 或 ``{\"type\": \"all\"}`` 可保留全部思考内容（默认行为），也可以用正整数 "
"``thinking_turns`` 保留最近的思考轮次："

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:137
msgid ""
"User messages containing only ``tool_result`` blocks do not start a new "
"assistant turn. Additional user content starts a new turn. Thinking attached"
" to unresolved tool calls is retained. Generation, cache-prefix processing "
"and token counting use the same edited history. Omitting ``edits`` is a no-"
"op; unsupported edit types return HTTP 400."
msgstr ""
"仅包含 ``tool_result`` "
"块的用户消息不会开始新的助手轮次。额外的用户内容会开始新的轮次。尚未完成的工具调用所关联的思考内容会被保留。生成、缓存前缀处理和 token "
"计数使用相同的编辑后历史。省略 ``edits`` 时不做修改；不支持的编辑类型返回 HTTP 400。"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:156
msgid "Backend capabilities"
msgstr "后端能力"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:158
msgid ""
"Xinference checks explicit feature requests against the loaded model and "
"engine before generation. Unsupported controls return HTTP 501; image input "
"to a text-only model returns HTTP 400. Translated, emulated, degraded and "
"rejected compatibility decisions are logged with their reasons. Capability "
"checks do not add features that the engine cannot implement."
msgstr ""
"Xinference 在生成前，会根据已加载的模型和引擎检查显式请求的功能。不支持的控制项返回 HTTP 501；向纯文本模型输入图像则返回 HTTP "
"400。转换、模拟、降级和拒绝等兼容性决策及其原因会记录到日志中。能力检查不会补上引擎无法实现的功能。"

#: ../source/user_guide/anthropic.rst:164
msgid ""
"The following limitations still apply. Supported controls also require a "
"compatible model and engine version, as described above."
msgstr "以下限制仍然适用。已支持的控制项也需要兼容的模型和引擎版本，具体条件见上文。"

